@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@* The console's frame (Notes/Anders/console-shell-plan-2026-10-13.md, stage 1): a header with the
   brand over the column's width and the trail at the content's edge; a side column with the
   page's sections where the page has any (the dataset page from stage 2, the admin and account
   areas), none on the team page; and, fixed at the foot of the window on the left, one row with
   notifications and the account. The layout itself renders statically; the header, the column
   and the foot are interactive islands that decide what they show. *@

<PageTitle>indx Rest API</PageTitle>

<div class="layout">
    <header class="header">
        <NavMenu />
    </header>

    <div class="shell">
        <ConsoleSideMenu />
        <main class="content">
            @Body
        </main>
    </div>
    <ConsoleFoot />
</div>
